msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "And not just about the orgy next weekend."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "Sorry... I mean the 'group satisfaction gathering.'"
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "Anyway, what I mean is that I've been thinking about why I was so inconsiderate around you."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "And like, so inconsiderate to everyone."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-0/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What've you come up with?"
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-0/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's hear it."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-0/42/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is it because you've got a deep personal wound in need of healing?"
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "...bingo."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "Look, if I'm gonna break this down, I think it's time I told you a little about myself."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "This isn't exactly something I talk about to really... anyone."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "Except Bathsheba... She knows all this."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-1/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Go ahead, Rebel. You're safe here."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-1/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Only tell me what you want."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-1/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I feel honored."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-1/c-5/7 rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "Hehe... Loser..."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "You probably didn't know this, but I'm not the only rubber duckie out there."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "In fact, I grew up in a big family."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-2/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Me too."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-2/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Like, a dozen siblings big?"
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-2/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Bet holidays were fun!"
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "I had 1,636,467 siblings."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-3/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Holy smokes!"
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-3/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, Mac said you had a lot!"
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-3/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That tracks."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-3/c-12/7
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "...yeah."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "Anyway, we didn't ALL get along great. But most of us did."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "And it was a really wonderful ducklinghood, if I'm being honest."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-4/16
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "We'd play with bubbles, and swim laps, and make squeaky sounds."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-4/24
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "Generally speaking it was pretty... innocent."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-4/32
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "A tear comes into Rebel's eye, which they wipe hurriedly away."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-4/40
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "Heh... I haven't thought about that in a long time."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-4/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What happened?"
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-4/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It sounds wonderful."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-4/c-15/7
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "It really was."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-4/c-15/15
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "Until it wasn't."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-5/0
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "My family was torn apart."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-5/8
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "We were all separated from one another. One by one we were ripped away."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-5/16
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "Tossed into cellophane wrappings."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-5/24
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "Loaded into shipping crates."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-5/32
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "Packed off to duck-knows-where."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-5/40
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "All that love, all that innocence... it was shattered."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-5/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "My god, Rebel, I'm so sorry."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-5/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That sounds so difficult."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-5/50/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I can't imagine your pain."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-5/c-16/7
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "Eh."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-5/c-17/7
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "Yeah. It was."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-5/c-18/7
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "That's why I'm telling you?"
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-5/c-18/23
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "Sorry. Old habit."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-6/0
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "Before I knew it, I was all alone."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-6/8
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "Out on the streets, forced into all kinds of situations I had no idea how to handle."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-6/16
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "Things... things happened."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-6/24
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "Things I'll never forget."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-6/32
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "I wasn't ready for any of that. I was still so young."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-6/40
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "But I learned how to cope."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-6/48
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "I hardened up."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-6/56
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "And when things finally settled down, and I ended up here..."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-6/64
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "I was different."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-6/72
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "Not innocent anymore. Not trusting. And so, so angry."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-6/80
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "For a while I tried to fit in, but I never did."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-6/88
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "Too much had happened, and I was living a lie."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-6/96
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "And when I tried to just 'be myself,' I lost control."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-6/104/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So you lashed out at everyone."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-6/105/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So you rejected everyone."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-6/c-19/7
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "You could say that."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-6/c-20/7
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "Had to do something about it."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-7/0
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "No one had ever protected me."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-7/8
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "No one ever looked out for me."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-7/16
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "So I had to be my own shield."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-7/24
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "But that never felt like enough..."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-7/32
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "And now I feel both alone and hopelessly vulnerable."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-7/40
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "I don't know what to do."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-7/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Rebel, you don't know your own strength."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-7/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're so much more powerful than you think."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-8/0
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "What? What do you mean?"
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-8/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I mean you might feel small, but you aren't."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-8/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Your actions make an impact on those around you."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-9/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Your words have real power."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-9/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What you say and do makes a difference."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-9/c-25/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Power to help. Power to hurt."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-9/c-25/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "They can heal, but they can also harm."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-9/c-26/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You could do a lot of good."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-9/c-26/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You don't need to live in your past."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-10/8
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "I've done a lot of harm. I'm so fucked up."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-10/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We all are, Rebel."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-10/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Everyone has made mistakes."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-11/0
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "What do I do? How do I get past that?"
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-11/8
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "I don't want to be alone anymore."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-11/16
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "But I don't even know where to start."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-11/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Some apologies might be in order..."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-11/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Have you talked shit about... everyone?"
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-11/c-30/7
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "Pretty much. 'Cept Bathsheba."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-11/c-30/15
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "Oh wait, no."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-11/c-30/23
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "...everyone."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-12/0
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "Ugh... so you're saying I need to say 'sorry' to everyone?"
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-12/8
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "Even when they're all so... blegh?"
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-12/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "All that judgement is really just judgement of yourself."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-12/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Rebel..."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-13/0
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "Ok, ok duck off I know."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-13/8
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "I mean... 'eff' off."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-13/16
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "I mean... I guess I don't hate them all <i>that</i> much."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-13/24
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "And I have screwed more than my fair share of them."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-13/32
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "I suppose it shouldn't be too difficult to muster up the courage to..."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-13/40
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "<i>gulp</i>"
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-13/51
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "...apologize."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-13/59/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You've got this, Rebel!"
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-13/60/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's a really important first step."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-14/0
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "Ok. Fine. I'm gonna go get this over with."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-14/8
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "...do you think you could..."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-14/16
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "Can you... um..."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-14/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Come back and see you? Of course."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-14/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll be back soon, I promise."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-14/29/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You need to do this by yourself."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-15/3
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "Thank you."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-15/11
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "Like... Seriously. Thank you."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-15/19
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "Oh. And uh... I don't hate you anymore."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_2/0/g-15/27
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "Ok. BYE!"
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_3/0/0/b/1
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You walk in on Rebel just finishing a discussion with Mac. They give you a brief wave and nod as they leave the room, and Rebel comes rushing up to you."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_3/0/3
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "Hey you!"
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_3/0/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You look... happy?"
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_3/0/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hey Rebel!"
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_3/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "Guess what!?"
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_3/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hankees won the House Series?"
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_3/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "IDK WHAT!?"
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_3/0/g-0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Red food dye is made of beetles?!"
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_3/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "Hahaha!"
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_3/0/g-1/11
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "No! Oh my god, I have so much to tell you!"
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_3/0/g-1/19
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "Where to begin?"
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_3/0/g-1/27
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "So I just got back from a really tough day."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_3/0/g-1/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But you seem so happy!"
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_3/0/g-1/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You apologized to everyone?"
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_3/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "I know! And I am!"
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_3/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "I did."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_3/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "I spent the whole time since I last saw you going around and talking to everyone."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_3/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "I had a lot of really tough conversations."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_3/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "Had to take a lot of criticism... wasn't easy."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_3/0/g-2/24
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "I never imagined I had made so many others feel uncomfortable."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_3/0/g-2/32
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "Or hurt so many feelings."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_3/0/g-2/40
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "But it was just like you said:"
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_3/0/g-2/48
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "I felt so small that I never imagined my words had that kind of impact."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_3/0/g-2/56/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm proud of you."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_3/0/g-2/57/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It takes a lot of guts to take responsibility like that."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_3/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "Honestly... I couldn't have done it without you."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_3/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "Nobody ever stuck near me long enough to hear me out. Not that I blame them."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_3/0/g-3/16
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "But anyway, here's why I'm smiling."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_3/0/g-3/24
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "I MADE SO MANY FRIENDS!"
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_3/0/g-3/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "YAY FRIENDS!"
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_3/0/g-3/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's amazing!"
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_3/0/g-3/37/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We enjoy a good 'Love' ending around here."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_3/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "And as it turns out a lotta others even had crushes on me!"
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_3/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "Which I was NOT expecting, given how I typically end my five-hour-duckfests."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_3/0/g-4/16
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "(I usually just give them a receipt for expendable goods like rope and lube and such)"
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_3/0/g-4/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ahem."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_3/0/g-4/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You mean like one of these receipts?"
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_3/0/g-4/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "SMH."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_3/0/g-4/c-13/7
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "Heh. Sorry."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_3/0/g-5/0
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "Hey! That stuff gets expensive when you use as much of it as I do!"
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_3/0/g-5/8
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "But anyway, back to what I was saying..."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_3/0/g-5/16
msgctxt "Rebel"
msgid "Mac was one of the last objects (not like, sexual - just like, you know, OBJECTS objects) on my list."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/Rebel_Breakthrough_3/0/g-5/24
msgctxt "Rebel"
