#: rebel_duck/rebel_mac_investigation/0/g-1/c-6/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Although I cannot normally ascertain the feelings of rubber ducks, so your mileage may vary."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/rebel_mac_investigation/0/g-1/c-6/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Oh me and Rebel?"
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/rebel_mac_investigation/0/g-1/c-6/15/c-1/15
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Why... nothing at all!"
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/rebel_mac_investigation/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "We were not talking."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/rebel_mac_investigation/0/g-1/c-7/15
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Rebel was searching for things."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/rebel_mac_investigation/0/g-1/c-7/23
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "And muttering a great deal."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/rebel_mac_investigation/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "I believe we might be nearing the end of this particular conversational requirement."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/rebel_mac_investigation/0/g-2/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's fair. I'll leave it be. Sorry for pressuring you."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/rebel_mac_investigation/0/g-2/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "C'mon Mac. It's for a good cause."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/rebel_mac_investigation/0/g-2/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "C'mon... It's for a good cause."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/rebel_mac_investigation/0/g-2/c-8/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "It is all right - I haven't felt a single pascal more pressure than usual."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/rebel_mac_investigation/0/g-2/c-8/15
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "So long!"
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/rebel_mac_investigation/0/g-2/c-9/11 rebel_duck/rebel_mac_investigation/0/g-2/c-10/11
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "A good cause! That's always the best kind of cause."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/rebel_mac_investigation/0/g-2/c-9/19 rebel_duck/rebel_mac_investigation/0/g-2/c-10/19
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Rebel is fine. They just ask me to look up some sort of news story every now and again."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/rebel_mac_investigation/0/g-2/c-9/27/0/s/0 rebel_duck/rebel_mac_investigation/0/g-2/c-10/27/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What news?"
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/rebel_mac_investigation/0/g-2/c-9/27/1/s/0 rebel_duck/rebel_mac_investigation/0/g-2/c-10/27/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "And?"
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/rebel_mac_investigation/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Well that's the thing. There's no news."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/rebel_mac_investigation/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "They show me their bar code number... and then begin to 'hound' me."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/rebel_mac_investigation/0/g-3/19
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "They are looking for a missing object report for someone called 'Regina Ru'bare the 73rd'."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/rebel_mac_investigation/0/g-3/27
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "But there's just... Nothing. No article. No police report."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/rebel_mac_investigation/0/g-3/35
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Makes me wonder if it's all make believe."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/rebel_mac_investigation/0/g-3/43/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The 73rd?"
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/rebel_mac_investigation/0/g-3/43/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ru'bare?"
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/rebel_mac_investigation/0/g-3/43/c-11/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Rebel assures me that's the number. Repeatedly. Every time."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/rebel_mac_investigation/0/g-3/43/c-12/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "The most I was able to find was it is the name of a longstanding family business located in Liechtenstein."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/rebel_mac_investigation/0/g-3/43/c-12/15
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Liechtenstein is a country in Europe."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/rebel_mac_investigation/0/g-3/43/c-12/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thanks, Mac. I'll remember that."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/rebel_mac_investigation/0/g-3/43/c-12/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thanks. I'll remember that."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/rebel_mac_investigation/0/g-3/43/c-12/23/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hm... seems like there should be more to this."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/rebel_mac_investigation/0/g-3/43/c-12/23/c-0/7 rebel_duck/rebel_mac_investigation/0/g-3/43/c-12/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "You know where to find me if you need to look up the spelling!"
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/rebel_mac_investigation/0/g-5/3
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Incidentally, if this 'Regina' is real, according to my searches they would have 1,636,467 identical siblings."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/rebel_mac_investigation/0/g-5/11
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "I suppose that number is large. Though I have seen larger."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/rebel_mac_investigation/0/g-5/19
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "1636468 for example."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/rebel_mac_investigation/0/g-5/27
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "I have told you all I can about this subject."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/rebel_mac_investigation/0/g-5/35
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "See me any time you need to spy on other objects!"
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/rebel_mac_investigation/0/g-5/43/b/1
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Farewell."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/rebel_mac_investigation/0/g-5/44/b/1
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Goodbye, my darling Alberto."
msgstr ""

#: rebel_duck/rebel_mac_investigation/0/g-5/45/b/1
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Farewell, my love."
msgstr ""
